  "notes_for_reviewer": "Official Poznań University of Technology pages \"First-cycle (B.Sc.) studies - Fees for international students\" and \"Second-cycle (M.Sc.) studies - Fees for international students\", read 2026-10-27 (tuition fees for international students in the 2026/2027 academic year; the amounts are set in Ordinance No. 18 of the Rector). The pages give two amounts per programme: the 1st semester in EUR and each subsequent semester in PLN. Both are stored; the PLN regular-semester amount is the first entry (the one the catalogue shows), the EUR first-semester amount is the second. One card per programme: the pages list several programmes under one price line, and all of them are stored with that price. Application (recruitment) fee: 100 PLN for candidates who must take the entrance exam and 85 PLN for those who do not; the single fee is paid regardless of the number of programmes. The higher value (100 PLN) is stored. The language of instruction is stated on the pages as \"studies in English\". Durations, intake months, format and deadlines are not on these pages. Not collected: Polish-language studies. ISCED-F codes are inferred from the programme names (a guess, to review). The suffix (BSc/MSc) is added from the level of the page. The institution was not in the database: it is added with institutions_extra_put.sql (Wikidata Q1678753, CC0)."
